Output temp/analyze.gif

Set Shell "fish"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set FontFamily "SauceCodePro Nerd Font"

Env JUMPER_FIXTURES "true"

Type "./jumper analyze"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Screenshot temp/analyze.png
Sleep 500ms
